  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Oxfam in EU HRDD Advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Advocacy on EU mandatory human rights due diligence legislation:

- Coordination and support to EU affiliates: preparation and follow-up of bi-weekly meetings, drafting of updates (emails), support to affiliates in their advocacy where needed.
- Research in support of Oxfam&apos;s advocacy and communication: providing facts/figures/illustrative examples for press releases or other communication materials, contributing to content/materials on specific topics e.g. gender, stakeholder consultation,climate in coordination with the Oxfam network and specific cases where Oxfam has been involved (for example Repsol in Peru).
- Outreach to EU decision-makers: meeting requests, mailings, drafting of briefings.
- Participation in meetings with allies: ECCJ coalition, Justice is Everybody&#x2019;s Business campaign members, other civil society organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
